---
import learning from '../data/learning.json';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';import {parables} from '../data/content.json';
---
<Shell title="Quranic Parables Studio"><section class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">Image. Contrast. Reflection.</span> <h1 class="editorial">{learning.heading}</h1> <p>Fourteen readings, each with a diagram to explore, a source-attributed explanation, and a question to take back to the passage.</p></section> <section class="panel bottom-gap"><div class="panel-body filters"><label class="field">Find a comparison<input id="filter" type="search" placeholder="Garden, light, tree…"/></label> <label class="field">Reading area<select id="category"><option value="">All areas</option>{[...new Set(parables.map(p=>p.area))].map(g=><option>{g}</option>)}</select></label> <label><input id="saved-only" type="checkbox"/> Saved only</label> <button class="button secondary" id="export">Copy saved reading list</button><span id="count" class="micro" aria-live="polite"></span></div></section><div class="card-grid">{parables.map(p=><><article class="panel activity-card" data-item-id={p.id} data-category={p.area}><span class="eyebrow">{p.area} · {p.passage.ref}</span> <h2><a data-reading-link={p.id} href={`/parable/${p.id}/`}>{p.title}</a></h2><div class="mini-path" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><span></span><i></i><span></span><i></i></div> <p>{p.nodes.map(n=>n.label).join(' → ')}</p> <div class="actions"><a class="button" href={`/parable/${p.id}/`}>Explore reading ↗</a> <button class="button secondary" data-save={p.id} aria-pressed="false">Save reading</button></div></article>{' '}</>)}</div> <div class="empty" id="empty" hidden><h2>No readings match</h2> <p>Try another image or choose All areas.</p></div><script>import '../lib/library';</script></Shell><style>.mini-path{display:flex;align-items:center;width:100%;padding:12px 0}.mini-path i{width:15px;height:15px;border:2px solid var(--accent);border-radius:50%}.mini-path span{height:1px;background:var(--line);flex:1}</style>
